# Scripts run inside a Linux container: LF always.
*.sh        text eol=lf
*.py        text eol=lf
Dockerfile  text eol=lf
*.md        text eol=lf
# 68000 test programs are kept byte for byte (line ends are part of what the
# editor's RichEdit round trip is tested on): never converted.
*.X68       -text
*.x68       -text
